                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14.5pt; line-height: 29px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14.5pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><strong>关于举办第十一届“瀚辰杯”辩论赛的通知（报名时间有修改）</strong></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px; text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">为激发学生思考与学习热情，提高学生综合素质，展现当代中学生的活力，校辩论社决定举办第十一届“瀚辰杯”辩论比赛。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px; text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">请</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">高一各班</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">有兴趣参加的同学尽快完成组队，组队要求：</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px; text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">4人一队，分为一、二、三、四辩（队内商议决定），并</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">在经班主任同意后向班长报名</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">，于</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">9月25日</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">（</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">周一）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">放学前统计完成，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">高二（3）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">班</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">朱彦伍</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">会前往各班收取</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">暂时不用确定辩位。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px; text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">9月26日</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">（</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">周二）</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">12:30</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">将举行会议，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">请全体辩论赛导师</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">社员</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">以及报名参加“瀚辰杯”辩论赛的同学到</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">阶梯教室4105</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">开会</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">会议时正式决定队伍成员，并抽签决定各队导师人选和初赛辩题。本次比赛若出现参赛队伍超过16支、人数不能成队等情况，辩论社社员优先参加</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">具体处理根据情况而定。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px; text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">现将比赛有关事宜通知如下：</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">一、时间</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">2023年10月-11月</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">二、赛制</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">淘汰赛制</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">三、组队</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">由辩论社高二导师带队，每队需要一个队名，可自行商定一辩、二辩、三辩及四辩。初赛导师确定队员及辩位之后，不可随意更改。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">四、时间表</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">1.预赛（十六进八）</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">2.复赛（八进四）</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">3.半决赛</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">4.决赛</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px; text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-decoration-line: underline;">具体安排以赛前具体通知为准</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">五、评判</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">1.辩论社将聘请评委对本次比赛进行全程评议。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">2.每场比赛的胜负判断，由评委评分并投票判定。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">3.每场比赛的最佳辩手由选票最高者获得</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">辩手个人表现只作为个人奖项的评审依据，与判断每场比赛的胜负无关。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">六、说明</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">1.比赛设冠军、亚军、金牌辩手奖项，以及最佳辩手若干（原则上每场一个）；2.请参赛选手准时到场，未按照比赛时间规定到场的队伍，将酌情扣分。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-size: 12pt; text-wrap: wrap; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑; line-height: 24px; text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">“瀚辰杯”辩论赛赛制如下，请有意向参加的同学详细阅读</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">，并根据赛制慎重考虑辩位安排。</span></p><table><tbody><tr class="firstRow" style="height: 0.21in;"><td style="padding: 0px 5.4pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: windowtext; vertical-align: middle;" width="53"><p style="margin-bottom: 0.001pt; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 24px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">序号</span></p></td><td style="padding: 0px 5.4pt; border-top-width: 1pt; border-right-width: 1pt; border-bottom-width: 1pt; border-left-s